{"id":"cc4fb97a-48be-4f67-b394-d35930c7a797","object":"chat.completion","created":1795147642,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"SELECT c.discount_type, ROUND(SUM(cu.discount_amount), 2) AS total_discount_amount\nFROM coupon_usages cu\nJOIN coupons c ON c.coupon_id = cu.coupon_id\nGROUP BY c.discount_type\nORDER BY c.discount_type\nLIMIT 100;","reasoning_content":"我们需要回答：只输出SQL。问题：每种折扣类型的优惠券分别带来了多少优惠金额？需要表 coupons discount_type, coupon_usages discount_amount。按discount_type分组，SUM(discount_amount) 优惠金额。需要过滤吗？没有，所有使用记录。关联 coupon_usages.coupon_id=coupons.coupon_id。输出折扣类型和优惠金额。ROUND两位。排序？未要求，可以按金额降序或折扣类型。规则11不随意排序？要求每种折扣类型，分组。可以 ORDER BY 优惠金额 DESC 或 discount_type。没有要求排序，但输出稳定。规则11说不为信息更全加排序？\"不为信息更全加列、分组或排序\"，但分组必须。排序可能不是必须，最好按discount_type。或者不排序？SQL允许无排序。但通常加 ORDER BY discount_type 合理？规则说不要加排序，除非需要。TopN才排序。这里不是TopN。直接GROUP BY 1。需要LIMIT？硬性规则3必须LIMIT，单行无GROUP BY聚合除外。这里GROUP BY，必须LIMIT。可以 LIMIT 100。输出别名 discount_type, total_discount_amount。ROUND(SUM(cu.discount_amount),2)。注意 discount_type 可能固定percent/fixed。查询：\n\nSELECT c.discount_type, ROUND(SUM(cu.discount_amount), 2) AS total_discount_amount\nFROM coupon_usages cu\nJOIN coupons c ON c.coupon_id = cu.coupon_id\nGROUP BY c.discount_type\nORDER BY c.discount_type\nLIMIT 100;\n\n这符合。需要注释？复杂多表可加，但不必。直接输出SQL。"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":2835,"completion_tokens":434,"total_tokens":3269,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":2688},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":366},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":2688,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":147},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}